## Standard .gitignore for C# projects

## .NET build artifacts
bin/
obj/
out/
*.user
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.cache
*.db
*.mdb

## Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vscode/
.idea/
*.csproj.user
*.vs/
*.ncrunchsolution
*.ncrunchproject

## Logs
*.log
logs/
LogFiles/

## Environment / Secrets
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
appsettings.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Development.json

## RSA Keys (IMPORTANT)
private.key
public.key

## Docker
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-data/
*.pid

## OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## NuGet
*.nupkg
packages/
.nuget/

## Publish output
publish/
artifacts/

## SQL Server local DB
*.mdf
*.ldf

## Rider / JetBrains
*.DotSettings.user

## Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
